# The official source distribution carries MySQL's bundled Boost, ICU,
# protobuf, zlib, zstd and other supported dependency snapshots. OpenSSL and ncurses are separate mandatory inputs, so they are pinned and built
# here too instead of being discovered from the host. MySQL requires patchelf
# when packaging custom OpenSSL libraries, so that build tool is pinned as well.
